# Trivy ignore file — P3-DO-07 (#191)
#
# Each entry MUST have a one-line reason and, ideally, a review date.
# Format: one CVE id per line. Only add a CVE here after confirming it is
# not exploitable in this image (not reachable, no fix available, or
# accepted risk signed off in the PR that adds it).
#
# Empty for now: the release workflow uses `ignore-unfixed: true`, so
# vulnerabilities with no upstream fix do not block the build and do not
# need listing here. Add fixable HIGH/CRITICAL CVEs here only with a
# documented reason.
#
# Example:
# CVE-2024-00000  # base-image glibc; not reachable from the Node runtime, upstream fix pending — review 2026-12
